  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO- Employment through Economic Development and Reconciliation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion and Strengthening of competitive sustainable enterprises and productive and sustainable employment in the conflict affected Northern region in Sri Lanka through Value Chain Development on fisheries and fruit and vegetable sectors. Including increased productivity; improved decent work opportunities; enhanced participation in decision-making by women and people with disabilities (PWDs); and local economic development approach adapted into development programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
